{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0ed3a5f6dada7c30fad190e6409b953dac3904594f4c982c92b894d0af241f3e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"chandra447/pi-hermes-memory@71ce9f0cf298 snapshot c661b291c1be6aa1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5cbeabec93f88b812f959465c06c588c7f21ec5df14845eb5e9b3613072f4657","slc_7a8b0d021a56e44d1069bff8437c03facc5b667dded6905c964dafa870a103dd","slc_8a6594bb9ae1e641950ad1ccb44443556e85bd7677d843b2c1843e7137382c64"],"source_ids":["src_032573c44b4453b9b740d354a30300ba"],"text":"In legacy-inject mode, when memory hits its character limit the extension spawns a one-shot consolidation child process that merges entries, then reloads and retries the save; in policy-only mode SQLite is the query authority and consolidation is manual via /memory-consolidate.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_11d11a9e7a75fb82606133515004e925b83d48417c6f2e400d51fb980408e806","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"chandra447/pi-hermes-memory@71ce9f0cf298 snapshot c661b291c1be6aa1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_65ad05ccf52b38aacb48215b9dc3f25f27c19b35d48ee1251c79c658a69355d2","slc_a18c0bf164a057ce53fa9cac3baef20088803277d64e3a106ee8334791b9fac4","slc_dc04b701da61b0198af18e921084f21f45bc4e3feb3419816c173f80a1688a5e"],"source_ids":["src_032573c44b4453b9b740d354a30300ba"],"text":"Standing instructions (/memory-pin) are a user-authored file injected into every session in every memory mode, capped at 20 entries / 2,000 characters, stored in STANDING.md which background processes cannot write; the feature is explicitly not tool enforcement.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_174d6ccc66bb2780849db40869c7a507e5576cd8de47c0b52f2b4e43cf640d3a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"chandra447/pi-hermes-memory@71ce9f0cf298 snapshot c661b291c1be6aa1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1e120c7675965feca51ee138e60c6c6737fe5c45a49c61d51470cd255cf5370f","slc_3d416bd57f5fd3317c5916d7b7df1587066fae896f993589a364e1f231740d01","slc_8a7eef41aef5a9ea335b0b1c9c01e7cb62ac9a7f85c6b3bbfb1f0628bb2721f1","slc_b387d77d00ff6f0a17753497d1312781edbe541db03309701835c1ca0113a261"],"source_ids":["src_032573c44b4453b9b740d354a30300ba"],"text":"For create and update, skill_manage prefers structured fields (when_to_use, procedure_steps, pitfalls, verification_steps) rendered into SKILL.md sections, and global creation has duplicate/similarity guards blocking exact slug matches and near-name collisions.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_549b4cc1458defe07304f3f91f87f8a9fa2be589e1464d010f413fa1495f0aa5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"chandra447/pi-hermes-memory@71ce9f0cf298 snapshot c661b291c1be6aa1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_702f669c7e601e883de37b0e3bd3a4036cd07a427b6295cd125a24e10a5db376"],"source_ids":["src_032573c44b4453b9b740d354a30300ba"],"text":"The extension manages three knowledge types: MEMORY.md facts (5,000-char cap), USER.md profile (5,000-char cap), and Pi-native SKILL.md procedures with unlimited size.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5a94283b8169a656389fee0af3cd4a261aa7698c18e07c334ad0707c65578e74","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"chandra447/pi-hermes-memory@71ce9f0cf298 snapshot c661b291c1be6aa1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_114df55e3ff261450a817739be72319eb38db99d8bc9f5f6718f1d173a108438","slc_2347d71021abc12f1ac6370b8b7d6b8a8e5c733449e3bc67715cff979088ec5c","slc_320eec8f451a9e721976ce563dc9474e4c7f7ed4af4d0d3f077c65cf3a954c0f"],"source_ids":["src_032573c44b4453b9b740d354a30300ba"],"text":"By default review, flush, correction save, and manual consolidation use an in-process completeSimple() side-channel, falling back to a pi -p --no-session subprocess on failure; reviewTransport can force subprocess-only behavior.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5bf8d5fecb60836b6e1d053e2ec3841f211f82ef69f3d17d804384d046475a70","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"chandra447/pi-hermes-memory@71ce9f0cf298 snapshot c661b291c1be6aa1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5eb968aafacd068d53d9e7b5abaaac4966d874535b9674f257679727aa088f25","slc_793875f8b324a0e1b6312b003158125516344a0d2efe32ae8b5893950cad37ca","slc_c3987ccbb436d8139c95cf71c056878446b7fa640716c8ea7a1d2ae5417b1ea8","slc_c6807086b65a5d4fa34dd093bc2dc636e2edeb11542fdb46b2f8d949571ac31e"],"source_ids":["src_032573c44b4453b9b740d354a30300ba"],"text":"Background review triggers every 10 turns or every 15 tool calls, with both counters reset after each review; correction detection saves immediately when the user corrects the agent.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_65d316b872c5828ec056e7cb0e120cb7d9a838d388c2be0335f396ee71ae598d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"chandra447/pi-hermes-memory@71ce9f0cf298 snapshot c661b291c1be6aa1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3ef8b8d8d2975c8dc6f3e64c0a94b8ae11c5c86d58e9d24f1b232a97f516d0d9"],"source_ids":["src_032573c44b4453b9b740d354a30300ba"],"text":"Recall in policy-only mode is probabilistic: a stored rule only takes effect if the agent calls memory_search before the relevant action, so prohibitions may be missed while preferences survive a missed lookup.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_66ed01198b939cf0e662e3121f2f3041bd65a0d953c2f47f0f71bc8d4e4835a5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"chandra447/pi-hermes-memory@71ce9f0cf298 snapshot c661b291c1be6aa1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_52845e7165067962440bfd4d9db5c05785d89bc0b46b047d777b6cee06681daf","slc_ac1962a12e14a6a4ffe13d3bb51c4bb01d77cb2830165b9b2ee0df15bc4136f5","slc_eb1b276afb0b9aba132a3a04439a50e007adc9bae406f4a4545f9ba52fac1bbe"],"source_ids":["src_032573c44b4453b9b740d354a30300ba"],"text":"Project-scoped skills are exposed to Pi via the resources_discover hook, which returns the active project's skills directory so Pi discovers them natively without copying into the global folder.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_71c1269ca8202fddf04f70b3b22db72280b795be23766a866cf9bbe9b6d514dc","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"chandra447/pi-hermes-memory@71ce9f0cf298 snapshot c661b291c1be6aa1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_cfed6609627be9d6d8fd9b8aa334c267d328b92cc46253881e3e23ef26e9fa04"],"source_ids":["src_032573c44b4453b9b740d354a30300ba"],"text":"Memory is stored at two tiers: global facts under ~/.pi/agent/pi-hermes-memory/ and per-project facts under ~/.pi/agent/projects-memory/<project>/, with project memories searchable when the cwd matches.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_720499bf6eb3082cf3586fdb2a464558987791b361f1c13cc447401faf30a128","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"chandra447/pi-hermes-memory@71ce9f0cf298 snapshot c661b291c1be6aa1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_29a7308274cb07b9ca3448aa194b8bc084bc5aeb7d7a3fae5fedfa04757e323e","slc_2ea86ae32ccad599f9d90a0db8f46a42c84409bf757941e62238d29180141120","slc_5792ae81e55ff5e2c5198e62ac8365ef0fe7935a5d047bf9ddec3435886f03c4","slc_735b3d9b43e35b0ad9666c00859f8adf4dabbcfdd505dade21c0633f8fd59f4d"],"source_ids":["src_032573c44b4453b9b740d354a30300ba"],"text":"An optional lazyInitialization mode defers Markdown/SQLite sync, memory loading, maintenance, and session indexing until the first memory operation, while pinned STANDING.md instructions and skill discovery remain available at startup; legacy-inject ignores the option.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_76e9df803ff5ea59a70ef0967467ffa240b208119eb05bab76f37c58969014b5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"chandra447/pi-hermes-memory@71ce9f0cf298 snapshot c661b291c1be6aa1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_043efd4003f28318811147de8ae2d4499b02806c478b10d36416ce8f9fc326a3","slc_7764135082265e2158759acb8e1a15b4c27c85309d2d556a9ac207bb3db45b8a"],"source_ids":["src_032573c44b4453b9b740d354a30300ba"],"text":"Documented limitation: the FTS5 trigram tokenizer only supports CJK substring search for terms of three or more characters; one- and two-character memory_search terms may not match.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7a9b488cd6ef4296820e19d84378c46a25e9de0be7474e2b5399c67e39398847","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"chandra447/pi-hermes-memory@71ce9f0cf298 snapshot c661b291c1be6aa1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2ccd6da6ccea68956f89ddc198f8c3e71b0305124d01b602f37c15328464fb71"],"source_ids":["src_032573c44b4453b9b740d354a30300ba"],"text":"An opt-in sessionSearch.variant of 'anchors' makes session_search read session JSONL files directly and return path:startLine-endLine anchors with short reasons instead of summaries.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_840b3c4c74a5ae2f348ac648de9d507d6b14ff232c355c08ccad8e9b6823f0fa","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"chandra447/pi-hermes-memory@71ce9f0cf298 snapshot c661b291c1be6aa1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_12196cff9e26db36268224256dacb3d4d7382e648dea40a9b3cc6c1f272380e7","slc_8ecd09de4576c76e0a3ef49793ce234f241af298fac86bbe7881c0783857a1ce","slc_d5fca4de0c3d3ee44efbc2ce6d0b9e57d3442bcb425a749136b71dce04723372"],"source_ids":["src_032573c44b4453b9b740d354a30300ba"],"text":"The agent gets memory write tools memory_add, memory_replace, and memory_remove with targets memory, user, project, and failure, plus a skill_manage tool with create, view, patch, update, and delete actions.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8a0d9d2138ba89ac9efa0eb7b9b1122d1d0f01a5c2e3f9ca9486a5bbbd7ab184","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"chandra447/pi-hermes-memory@71ce9f0cf298 snapshot c661b291c1be6aa1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ad37226c8e3978d3b4396b0cc0e5979c6fc049991d9a17a2cae19ddb3a866277","slc_cbc7ecf0185725c1c3cae0f46d385ef890cd08c4b65a9d8a311fec5aecd09ab1"],"source_ids":["src_032573c44b4453b9b740d354a30300ba"],"text":"Slash commands include /memory-insights, /memory-skills, /memory-consolidate, /memory-interview, /memory-index-sessions, /memory-sync-markdown, /memory-preview-context, /memory-pin, and /learn-memory-tool.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_97623f29447ae2caf1d26dfed8c6ad193480464a0fe682bc2d4815325d48ef54","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"chandra447/pi-hermes-memory@71ce9f0cf298 snapshot c661b291c1be6aa1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_62932d9019e1d2fe93cb42ede3171c0246fdd477821ff23dda90a569662bc4c8"],"source_ids":["src_032573c44b4453b9b740d354a30300ba"],"text":"Memory blocks are wrapped in <memory-context> XML tags with a guard note stating they are not new user input, to prevent the model from treating stored facts as instructions.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d68f1b0302c53cf03ffc047b53c7189bbdd59481ef8649e35b563222ffde01be","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"chandra447/pi-hermes-memory@71ce9f0cf298 snapshot c661b291c1be6aa1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9d10c0c1750b6fe682b6f62a1016189334d422f54227e86ad0fd5a2c5b3f59e2","slc_b55ec66a0aebfbf903be6a519e73266865cdeef9a67609afd93d532d301cabd1","slc_e2f9de2fe764c77cb03406bd34ea6718b75e5fd7d4c004e6df29009d315aa299"],"source_ids":["src_032573c44b4453b9b740d354a30300ba"],"text":"The extension depends on better-sqlite3, a native addon that can fail with Node ABI mismatches (e.g. Homebrew-installed Pi); it attempts one automatic npm rebuild and documents a manual rebuild path.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_db4b31709c9d5819e3c3635381caf139c887469b57fba85194e2aca9e57210e7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"chandra447/pi-hermes-memory@71ce9f0cf298 snapshot c661b291c1be6aa1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7764135082265e2158759acb8e1a15b4c27c85309d2d556a9ac207bb3db45b8a","slc_8e07d515898847691d8666d5c1107006117f9272dc2e6d2af7d4001fed8953da","slc_b630f944d1ae89e6d41222eb8f059469a7cfb81d5503c75c26784522d83e6339"],"source_ids":["src_032573c44b4453b9b740d354a30300ba"],"text":"Search tools include session_search over past conversations and memory_search over the extended store; FTS5 with a trigram tokenizer supports multi-word, quoted-phrase, OR-operator, and CJK substring queries of three or more characters.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_deeb1d9cfe252fe7a36fe1ed59c9c8e77687df74ff488f6d1486bdee6e0b3dfd","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"chandra447/pi-hermes-memory@71ce9f0cf298 snapshot c661b291c1be6aa1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_34ab79747f8e6afeb76d27968cabb825383f4e2969a66e6ccc8aaa17eb76369e","slc_4950acf20077b0e23411c4874b02c9a063ba93cf7aa2e0ddd694c6d6d16336b6","slc_5345f388ec1936878d1941a75df869dc08b96e82546602e236fa16d92af37367","slc_a124a218769ef484227a615ea97faaee8cecfd4315870c6eca31e248c36bad04"],"source_ids":["src_032573c44b4453b9b740d354a30300ba"],"text":"A hybrid architecture keeps Markdown as the human-readable source of truth while mirroring successful writes into a SQLite store (sessions.db) queried via memory_search; failed core writes are not silently spilled into SQLite-only storage.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e6d54ad2abe524e1dd97076f7acc92ba99b5c23b081c67117ab2d66b9828e645","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"chandra447/pi-hermes-memory@71ce9f0cf298 snapshot c661b291c1be6aa1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_fe632a7a9ef6267fe044e717dfb36d049137471993fdab101be43f3b79e984c0"],"source_ids":["src_032573c44b4453b9b740d354a30300ba"],"text":"By default full Markdown memories are not injected into the system prompt; instead a <memory-policy> block tells the agent when to call memory_search, keeping first-turn token usage low.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:41:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_872da1d25964457584d7ae325047402c"}
